Analysis: Factors associated with short stays/poor outcomes.
The following input columns best explain the worst-performing records:
 - Age
 - JobLevel
 - jobRole
 - MonthlyIncome
 - NumCompaniesWorked
 - TotalWorkingYears
 - YearsSinceLastPromotion

These factors are statistically distinct in the worst-performing group,
suggesting they are key drivers of employee attrition or dissatisfaction.

